OL,3,ANational security can't come at expense
OL,4,Aof social security, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said he would fund defence and
OL,7,Fget the welfare bill down in "the
OL,8,FLabour way", by changing education,
OL,9,Fsupporting young people and providing
OL,10,Fmore mental health support.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
