OL,3,APolice launch criminal investigation
OL,4,Ainto Reform UK donations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police is carrying out
OL,7,Fa criminal investigation into
OL,8,Fallegations Reform UK broke the law in
OL,9,Frelation to foreign funding, following
OL,10,Fa broadcast by Channel 4 News last
OL,11,Fweek.
OL,13,FAn undercover reporter recorded two
OL,14,Fsenior Reform aides apparently
OL,15,Fsuggesting a way around electoral law
OL,16,Fto secure foreign party donations, one
OL,17,Fof which would have totalled #500,000.
OL,19,FThe police investigation by the Met's
OL,20,FSpecial Enquiry Team is being folded
OL,21,Finto an inquiry that has been under way
OL,22,Finto other donations to the party.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
