OL,3,AOil hits $100 a barrel for first time
OL,4,Asince July after US and Houthi strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemen's Iran-backed Houthi movement
OL,7,Falso attacked oil facilities in Saudi
OL,8,FArabia on Tuesday and have been
OL,9,Ftargeting tankers in the Red Sea.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
